00:00:47.591 --> 00:00:51.061
ANDREW, YOU ARE ON THE RADIO

00:00:49.059 --> 00:00:52.863
TODAY AND IT WAS SO MOVING.

00:00:51.195 --> 00:00:54.798
WE'VE DONE SO MUCH ALREADY TO

00:00:52.996 --> 00:00:55.532
BRING SANITY TO THIS

00:00:54.932 --> 00:00:59.670
CONVERSATION ABOUT SCHOOL SAFETY

00:00:55.666 --> 00:01:01.338
AND SO FORTH, AND OUR VIEWERS --

00:00:59.803 --> 00:01:03.240
OUR HEART GOES OUT TO YOU,

00:01:01.472 --> 00:01:04.074
THANK YOU FOR BEING WITH US

00:01:03.373 --> 00:01:06.276
TONIGHT.

00:01:04.208 --> 00:01:07.745
YOU HAD SOME VERY POIGNANT AND

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:17.654
POINTED WORDS, ANDREW, ABOUT

00:01:07.878 --> 00:01:18.388
THESE VIDEOS BEING RELEASED.

00:01:17.788 --> 00:01:22.059
READING THOSE TRANSCRIPTS MADE

00:01:18.522 --> 00:01:24.628
ME SICK TO MY STOMACH.

00:01:22.192 --> 00:01:30.200
SO I'M GLAD THAT I DIDN'T REALLY

00:01:24.762 --> 00:01:34.905
LOOK AT THE VIDEOS.

00:01:30.334 --> 00:01:39.643
HE KNEW HE WAS GOING TO BE

00:01:35.038 --> 00:01:41.278
GLORIFIED IN THE NEWS.

00:01:40.043 --> 00:01:43.080
AND USING THE NAME AND PICTURES

00:01:41.411 --> 00:01:43.413
THROUGHOUT THE MEDIA IN THE

00:01:43.213 --> 00:01:45.783
COUNTRY.

00:01:43.547 --> 00:01:46.984
I THINK WE COULD USE A LOT AT

00:01:45.916 --> 00:01:49.486
THIS AND NOT REALLY SHOW THEIR

00:01:47.117 --> 00:01:49.787
NAMES OR THEIR FACES IN THE

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:51.622
MEDIA.

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:52.489
I THINK IT WOULD MAKE A

00:01:51.755 --> 00:01:53.690
DIFFERENCE.

00:01:52.623 --> 00:01:56.593
&gt;&gt; Laura: THAT'S WHAT YOU

00:01:53.824 --> 00:01:58.629
WANT, AND YOU ARE RIGHT, HE

00:01:56.727 --> 00:02:00.731
REFERENCED THAT.

00:01:58.762 --> 00:02:03.367
MARK FUHRMAN, PREMEDITATED

00:02:00.864 --> 00:02:05.068
MURDER IN FLORIDA.

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:07.704
THIS KIND OF EXPLODES THAT.

00:02:05.202 --> 00:02:09.506
THERE IS NO WAY, I THINK THEY

00:02:07.838 --> 00:02:10.240
COULDN'T CHARGE HIM NOW WITH

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:11.275
PREMEDITATED MURDER AND THAT

00:02:10.374 --> 00:02:14.344
COULD MEAN THE POSSIBILITY OF

00:02:11.408 --> 00:02:17.648
THE DEATH PENALTY.

00:02:14.478 --> 00:02:20.551
TELL US WHY.

00:02:17.781 --> 00:02:23.253
&gt;&gt; THE RELEASE OF THE VIDEOS HAS

00:02:20.684 --> 00:02:24.855
NO EVIDENTIARY OR INFORMATIONAL

00:02:23.387 --> 00:02:26.890
VALUE WHATSOEVER.

00:02:24.988 --> 00:02:28.125
HE HAS CONFESSED AND HE WANTS A

00:02:27.024 --> 00:02:30.260
LIFE SENTENCE IN EXCHANGE FOR NO

00:02:28.258 --> 00:02:33.130
DEATH PENALTY.

00:02:30.394 --> 00:02:35.666
THE MEDIA AT LARGE A REQUEST UP

00:02:33.263 --> 00:02:37.067
FAITH BECAUSE OF FLORIDA LAW OF

00:02:35.799 --> 00:02:38.735
DISCOVERY, ONCE DISCOVERY IS

00:02:37.201 --> 00:02:40.771
MADE THEY CAN ASK PRETTY MUCH

00:02:38.869 --> 00:02:43.974
ANYTHING THAT THE DEFENSE

00:02:40.904 --> 00:02:47.044
ATTORNEY AND THE PROSECUTOR HAS.

00:02:44.107 --> 00:02:48.245
THEY OBVIOUSLY SHOWED NO

00:02:47.177 --> 00:02:49.947
RESPONSIBILITY BY RELEASING

00:02:48.378 --> 00:02:51.849
THIS, THIS INFORMATION NOW IN

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:54.718
FRONT OF EVERY JUROR IN THE

00:02:51.982 --> 00:02:56.620
COUNTRY, NOT JUST FLORIDA, IS

00:02:54.852 --> 00:02:57.221
SEEING SOMETHING THAT MAKES THE

00:02:56.753 --> 00:02:59.456
DEATH PENALTY CASE VERY

00:02:57.354 --> 00:03:02.459
DIFFICULT FOR THE PROSECUTORS,

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:04.161
BECAUSE NOW, WHEN YOU GO INTO

00:03:02.593 --> 00:03:05.863
THAT COURTROOM, THE JURORS HAVE

00:03:04.294 --> 00:03:08.866
ALL SEEN THIS.

00:03:05.996 --> 00:03:10.467
NOT ONLY DOES HE SHOW

00:03:08.999 --> 00:03:12.069
PREMEDITATION BUT HE KIND OF

00:03:10.601 --> 00:03:14.371
ARGUES AGAINST A MENTAL DEFECT.

00:03:12.202 --> 00:03:15.906
HE SEEMS COMPLETELY IN CONTROL

00:03:14.504 --> 00:03:18.575
OF HIS PLANNING, COMPLETELY IN

00:03:16.039 --> 00:03:23.847
CONTROL OF THE MANNING, AND THIS

00:03:18.709 --> 00:03:26.650
IS HIS MANIFESTO.

00:03:23.981 --> 00:03:27.384
&gt;&gt; THIS GUY IS LIKE, HE IS

00:03:26.783 --> 00:03:30.821
INSANE, HE DOESN'T HAVE CONTROL

00:03:27.517 --> 00:03:39.062
OF HIS FACULTIES.

00:03:30.954 --> 00:03:41.331
HE KNEW WHAT HE WAS DOING.

00:03:39.196 --> 00:03:43.467
&gt;&gt; WHAT'S WORSE IS THE VIDEOS.

00:03:41.465 --> 00:03:44.201
MY DAUGHTER HAPPEN TO GET

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:45.869
MURDERED IN THE HALLWAY AND SO

00:03:44.334 --> 00:03:48.739
THAT WILL BE THE NEXT VIDEOS

00:03:46.003 --> 00:03:49.273
