00:03:48.872 --> 00:03:51.508
AT.

00:03:49.406 --> 00:03:53.543
SHE WAS ON THE THIRD FLOOR, SHE

00:03:51.642 --> 00:03:55.045
WAS SHOT NINE TIMES AND THAT'S

00:03:53.677 --> 00:03:57.648
ON THE CAMERA, ALSO.

00:03:55.178 --> 00:03:59.416
THEY WILL BE LOOKING FOR THOSE

00:03:57.781 --> 00:04:00.617
VIDEOS, NEXT.

00:03:59.549 --> 00:04:01.351
THAT WILL BE HEART WRENCHING.

00:04:00.751 --> 00:04:04.054
&gt;&gt; Laura: WHAT THEY ARE TRYING

00:04:01.485 --> 00:04:05.055
TO DO IS KEEP THE SCHOOL

00:04:04.187 --> 00:04:07.090
SHOOTING VIDEO GAME GOING FOR

00:04:05.188 --> 00:04:08.725
