00:04:18.201 --> 00:04:22.105
THEY ARE NOT FOCUSED ON WHAT

00:04:20.237 --> 00:04:23.740
ANDREW IS FOCUSED ON, HOW TO

00:04:22.239 --> 00:04:24.875
MAKE THE SCHOOLS SAFE.

00:04:23.874 --> 00:04:27.678
METAL DETECTORS OR WHATEVER THEY

00:04:25.008 --> 00:04:27.978
HAVE TO DO TO MAKE THESE SCHOOLS

00:04:27.811 --> 00:04:29.212
