00:04:31.848 --> 00:04:35.252
THANK GOODNESS.

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:36.753
MARK, FINAL WORDS?

00:04:35.385 --> 00:04:38.088
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE LEGISLATION ON THE

00:04:36.887 --> 00:04:40.557
