00:04:51.234 --> 00:04:54.471
THEY SHOULD BE PROACTIVE.

00:04:52.369 --> 00:04:55.739
WHY SHOULD THEY BE WAITING FOR

00:04:54.604 --> 00:04:58.508
ANOTHER SHOOTING, BECAUSE THERE

00:04:55.872 --> 00:05:00.110
